      "en": "He spoke this parable. “A certain man had a fig tree planted in his vineyard, and he came seeking fruit on it and found none.",
      "ko": "이에 비유로 말씀하시되 한 사람이 포도원에 무화과나무를 심은 것이 있더니 와서 그 열매를 구하였으나 얻지 못한지라",
      "source_text_hash": "7994627affe5c64bcbe2decf313f11b1f574fc4af472e1e3c9360cddf736f4b9",
      "translation_text_hash": "29118209a8b721f952eebb081bc65535090855dab322842b053df54cd6643601",
