      "en": "Behold, there was a woman who had a spirit of infirmity eighteen years. She was bent over and could in no way straighten herself up.",
      "ko": "십 팔년 동안을 귀신들려 앓으며 꼬부라져 조금도 펴지 못하는 한 여자가 있더라",
      "source_text_hash": "0cea01451b57e44c7e660ff0a08dd11afe40824e67bf03c32f134e3f065ab049",
      "translation_text_hash": "d2171174814577b07f8740fc57f2cff8d9cb51e60544a8d736171870f12ce417",
